window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It all comes down to this.<br> <br> Mari Marcosa's family—the three men who are her very world—is back together.</p> <p>She won’t let anything tear them apart. Not again.<br> <br> May God have mercy on her enemies.<br> <br> Because she won’t.<br> <br> •••••<br> <br> Author’s note: Vicious Throne is the conclusion of the Gilded Empire series, and cannot be enjoyed out of order. This is a \"Why Choose?\" romance with violence, dark themes, and ruthlessly possessive—and protective—men.</p>"; 
